    "created_at": "2022-01-06T10:28:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-01-06T10:28:29Z",
    "body": "> The `blur()` method steps are to do nothing.\r\n\r\nseems reasonable to me, yeah. (In Firefox it can still do something if you flip a preference, see https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1690798, but it's not clear we want to keep that around and it's not the default configuration.)",
